# API_PKC

This directory is the official API_PKC KEX adaptation package for MAMBA-NIKE.

NIKE is an RLWQ-Z key exchange / non-interactive key exchange scheme.
NIKE was previously developed under the working name Mercury.

- `Implementations/Reference_Implementation`: ISO C reference-side submission layout.
- `Implementations/Optimized_Implementation`: AVX2 optimized submission layout.
- `Test_Vectors/`: text vectors only; formal MAMBA-NIKE vectors are pending because current KAT_KEX runtime still has blocking crashes.
